---
import type {ImageMetadata} from 'astro';
import ApprovedImage from './ApprovedImage.astro';
import FelonGallery from './FelonGallery.astro';
import apparel from '../data/felon-apparel.json';
import brand from '../data/felon-brand.json';
const files=import.meta.glob<{default:ImageMetadata}>('../assets/felon-*/*.{jpg,png,webp}',{eager:true});
const apparelItems=apparel.map(x=>({image:files['../assets/felon-apparel/'+x.file].default,label:x.label,group:x.group}));
const brandItems=(group:string)=>brand.filter(x=>x.group===group).map(x=>({image:files['../assets/felon-brand/'+x.file].default,label:x.label,group:'category' in x ? x.category : undefined}));
const sections=[{id:'brand-creative',title:'Brand & campaign creative',line:'We designed Felon’s logos and campaign creative, building a family of spade, skull and workshop marks that could carry the brand across the website, clothing and physical space. We created the mockups as part of that work, showing how each design would live on the finished piece.'},{id:'merchandise',title:'Merchandise',line:'We extended the identity into merchandise, tags and printed pieces. Alongside the design and mockups, we handled printing for tags and apparel, carrying the same brand details from artwork into production.'},{id:'shop-signage',title:'The in-store experience',line:'Our work extended into the store: merchandising, color, customer flow and in-store graphics. We considered how customers moved through the space and encountered the products, using the identity across displays, signage and the shop environment.'},{id:'around-the-shop',title:'Around the shop',line:'The motorcycles, workshop and people give the design its setting. These photographs show the environment where the identity, apparel and retail work came together.'}];
---
<article class="felon-case">
  <section class="felon-section"><div class="wrap felon-overview"><div><p class="kick">The engagement</p><h2 class="disp">One identity.<br />Every touchpoint.</h2></div><div><p>ZINC designed the Felon Motorwerk experience across the website, brand identity, campaigns, apparel and the store itself. The work connected what customers saw online with what they wore, bought and encountered in person.</p><p>We created the logos, artwork and mockups; designed the in-store graphics; and handled printing for tags and apparel. In the retail space, our scope also included merchandising, color and customer flow.</p></div></div></section>
  <nav class="felon-jumps wrap" aria-label="Felon case study sections"><a href="#website">Website</a><a href="#apparel">Apparel</a>{sections.map(s=><a href={'#'+s.id}>{s.title}</a>)}<a href="#outdoor-marketing">Outdoor marketing</a></nav>
  <section id="website" class="felon-section" data-case-pages="felon-motorwerk"><div class="wrap felon-website"><div><p class="kick">Digital / Website</p><h2 class="disp">The digital expression.</h2><p>We designed the website to bring Felon’s motorcycle identity onto the screen. The imagery, logo treatments and visual tone connect the digital experience to the apparel and shop branding.</p><p>We also created the device mockups shown here to present that design across screen formats.</p></div><figure data-case-mockup="felon-motorwerk"><ApprovedImage name="felon-white-devices.png" alt="Felon Motorwerk website creative on desktop, laptop and phone" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 55vw" /></figure></div></section>
  <section id="apparel" class="felon-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="felon-section-head"><p class="kick">Felon Gear / Apparel design</p><h2 class="disp">Apparel<span>.</span></h2><p>We designed the apparel graphics and product mockups across tees, long sleeves, hats and women’s pieces, adapting the marks to different garments and color combinations. Our involvement also covered apparel printing, connecting the design work to the physical collection.</p></div><FelonGallery items={apparelItems} apparel /></div></section>
  {sections.map(section=><section id={section.id} class="felon-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="felon-section-head"><p class="kick">Felon / Brand applications</p><h2 class="disp">{section.title}<span>.</span></h2><p>{section.line}</p></div><FelonGallery items={brandItems(section.id)} wide creative={section.id==='brand-creative'} /></div></section>)}
  <section id="outdoor-marketing" class="felon-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="felon-section-head"><p class="kick">Felon / Outdoor marketing</p><h2 class="disp">Outdoor marketing<span>.</span></h2><p>We designed the outdoor creative to carry the same Felon identity beyond the shop. The billboard brought the brand marks and website address into a larger-format application.</p></div><figure class="felon-video"><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1280" height="720" poster="/media/felon/outdoor-marketing-poster.jpg" aria-label="Felon Motorwerk outdoor marketing promo" aria-describedby="felon-video-description"><source src="/media/felon/outdoor-marketing.mp4" type="video/mp4" /><a href="/media/felon/outdoor-marketing.mp4">Watch the Felon Motorwerk promo</a></video><figcaption id="felon-video-description">Billboard footage featuring the red spade emblem, Felon Motorwerk branding and website address.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
</article>
<style>
.felon-case{background:#f0f0ed;color:#111;--ink:#111;--muted:#595b5e;--line:#d5d6d7}.felon-hero{padding:75px 0}.felon-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44% 56%;align-items:center;gap:0}.felon-hero h1{font-size:clamp(68px,8.8vw,138px);line-height:.94;margin:28px 0}.felon-hero h1 span,.felon-section h2 span{color:#fa268c}.felon-lede{font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.4;color:#c7c9cb;margin:24px 0}.felon-hero .arrow{color:#f5f6f7}.felon-hero-art{padding-left:20px}.felon-hero-art :global(img){width:100%;height:auto;display:block;mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#000 8%)}.felon-jumps{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 30px;padding-block:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #c5c7c9}.felon-jumps a{font:12px/1.5 var(--fm);color:#111!important;padding:8px 0}.felon-section{padding:75px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d5d6d7;scroll-margin-top:90px}.felon-section h2{font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,88px);line-height:1;margin:20px 0;color:#111}.felon-section p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;max-width:52ch}.felon-section .kick{font:11px/1.5 var(--fm);color:#626467}.felon-section-head{margin-bottom:42px}.felon-website{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,35fr) minmax(0,65fr);align-items:center;gap:24px}.felon-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.25fr);gap:clamp(24px,6vw,90px)}.felon-overview p+p,.felon-website p+p{margin-top:18px}@media(max-width:800px){.felon-overview{grid-template-columns:1fr}}.felon-website figure{margin:0;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #11111108}.felon-website :global(img){width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.felon-group+.felon-group{margin-top:48px}.felon-group h3{font:500 15px/1.5 var(--fm);padding-bottom:16px;margin:0 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #c5c7c9}.felon-video{margin:0;padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7d8d9;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #11111108}.felon-video video{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#111}.felon-video figcaption{padding-top:16px;font:12px/1.6 var(--fm)}.felon-back{padding-block:40px}.felon-back a{color:#111!important}.felon-case a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #008d91;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:800px){.felon-hero-grid,.felon-website{grid-template-columns:1fr}.felon-hero{padding:40px 0}.felon-hero-art{padding:30px 0 0}.felon-hero-art :global(img){mask-image:none}.felon-section{padding:48px 0}.felon-website{gap:25px}.felon-hero h1{font-size:clamp(65px,13vw,104px)}}

:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .felon-case :is(.felon-section,.felon-jumps,.felon-group h3){border-color:var(--line)}
:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .felon-section h2{color:var(--ink)}
:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .felon-section .kick{color:var(--muted)}
:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .felon-case :is(.felon-jumps a,.felon-back a){color:var(--ink)!important}
:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .felon-video{background:var(--pn);border-color:var(--line)}

</style>
